Scavezza Collo, Top Down 2D Overhead Racing Game

Select:
Practice to do laps around circuits
Race AI to do a race with equal machinery
Race AI FFA to do a race with randomized racers
Settings to set mobile/PC Controls
Almanac to see every car, track and racer.

Notes: 
- You can edit racers names in the Almanac
- The rear white thing is NOT lights, They are slipstream, go in to get a boost